=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Ethical &amp; Responsible Breeding</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">We’re widely recognised as the <strong>best blue Staffy breeders in the UK</strong>, adhering to the highest ethical standards. Our <a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-breeding-dogs-glasgow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">breeding dogs, Maggie and Jones</a>, are beloved family pets, health-tested, and <strong>KC registered</strong>, ensuring the best lineage for our pups. Learn more about our philosophy on our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-uk-breeders/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">About Us Page</a></strong>.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-rabfyfgq uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Uncompromising Health</strong></h3></div></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\"> All blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies we offer are from L-2-HGA clear parents and undergo thorough vet checks, microchipping, and initial vaccinations. Your peace of mind is our priority. We also provide a <strong>comprehensive health guarantee</strong> against specific genetic conditions, clearly outlined in our Puppy Sales Contract. While Staffies are generally robust, you can learn more about potential <strong><a href=\"https://www.pdsa.org.uk/pet-help-and-advice/looking-after-your-pet/puppies-dogs/medium-dogs/staffordshire-bull-terrier\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffordshire Bull Terrier Health Issues from PDSA</a></strong>. Discover our full health protocols on our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Health &amp; Care Page</a></strong>.</p><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-x2ueaeps uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>Home-Raised &amp; Socialized:</strong> </h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Our puppies are born and raised in our bustling Glasgow home, not in kennels. This constant human interaction and early socialisation lay the foundation for a confident, adaptable, and affectionate Staffy temperament, making them ideal family pets. For general guidance on how<strong><a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/health/puppycare\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> to Take Care of Your Dog, the RSPCA</a></strong> offers valuable advice.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-q8alyc8g alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-x2fpdi99 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Blue Staffy puppies inside a safe delivery van for UK nationwide transport.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-delivery-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-delivery-uk-760.webp 760w, /images/blue-staffy-puppy-delivery-uk.webp 1024w\" width=\"1024\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-rzgaddfs\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-whrokkpo uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\"><strong>Need Staffy puppy delivery to London, Manchester, or beyond? We can help!</strong></h2><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Safe &amp; Convenient UK-Wide Puppy Delivery</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Don’t let distance stand between you and your dream <strong>blue and tan staffy</strong> or a pure blue staffy. We provide safe and reliable <strong>UK-wide puppy delivery</strong> using trusted, <strong>DEFRA-approved pet transport services</strong>. This means whether you’re looking for pedigree blue staffy pups for sale and are located in bustling <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-for-sale-glasgow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Glasgow</a></strong>, the vibrant West Midlands of <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-wolverhampton/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Wolverhampton</a></strong>, the capital of Wales in <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-cardiff-wales/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Cardiff</a></strong>, or the historic city of <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffies-newcastle-under-lyme/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Newcastle</a></strong>, your new family member will arrive safely and comfortably. For general guidance on pet transport, you can review <strong><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a819d3bed915d74e623335d/pb10308-dogs-cats-welfare-060215.pdf\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DEFRA’s guidance on Transporting your pet (General Guidance)</a></strong>.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">More UK Cities</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-tcedwunq alignfull uagb-is-root-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-niuywccs\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Your Journey to a Blue Staffy: FAQs for Buyers</h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">We understand you’ll have questions when looking for a credible blue Staffordshire terrier breeder. Here are some common inquiries to help you in your search:</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-qcfz4osr\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-bblriuqn uagb-faq-icon-row-reverse uagb-faq-layout-accordion uagb-faq-expand-first-false uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-r55g5zfj\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What health clearances do your blue Staffy puppies come with?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>All our <strong>KC-registered blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies</strong> come from parents thoroughly tested and clear for L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4. Pups receive their first vaccinations, worming, and a full vet health check before leaving us.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-niymlz5f\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Are blue Staffies suitable for first-time dog owners?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Yes, with proper guidance and commitment to training, <strong>blue Staffies</strong> make excellent companions for <strong>first-time dog owners</strong>. They are highly intelligent, eager to please, and incredibly loyal. We provide comprehensive <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-blog-guides/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Puppy Care Guides</a></strong> and ongoing support to ensure a smooth transition.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-dakats3i\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>How do I know I’m buying from reputable blue Staffy breeders?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We encourage all prospective owners to ask questions and check credentials. We’re <strong>KC registered</strong>, adhere to strict ethical breeding standards, perform extensive health testing, and raise our puppies in a loving home environment. Our transparent approach aims to build trust. Learn more about the breed on our <strong><a href=\"/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Breed Guide</a></strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-cfp0bjdy\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>How much does a blue Staffy cost UK?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>The Staffy puppy prices for a KC registered Staffy from a reputable breeder in the UK, like BlueStaffyUK.uk, typically range from £850 to £1,200. This investment reflects the extensive care, health screening (including clear L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4 status of parents), vaccinations, microchipping, and initial socialization your puppy receives. While it might seem a significant cost when you buy a <strong>Staffordshire bull terrier</strong>, it ensures you’re bringing home a healthy, well-adjusted companion with traceable lineage. We believe in transparency and value, ensuring every pup is given the best start. You can learn more about our commitment to health on our <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Health &amp; Care Page</a></strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-1c59888a\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Is a Staffy a pitbull?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>No, the Staffordshire Bull Terrier is a distinct breed from the American Pit Bull Terrier, although they share some ancestral roots. The Staffy is recognized as a separate breed by The Kennel Club and has its specific breed standard, as we mentioned on our homepage.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-326025e0\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong><strong>Why do Staffies scratch so much?</strong></strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Excessive scratching in Staffies can be a sign of allergies (food or environmental), skin dryness, parasites (fleas, mites), or even stress. If your Staffy is scratching frequently, it’s important to consult with a veterinarian to determine the cause and appropriate treatment.</p></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-kcxsq9uj uagb-faq-icon-row-reverse uagb-faq-layout-accordion uagb-faq-expand-first-false uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-fdoyjuiy\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Is a blue Staffy a good family dog?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Absolutely! Blue Staffordshire Bull Terriers are renowned for being incredibly loyal, affectionate, and patient companions, earning them the nickname “nanny dog.” Their loving nature makes them excellent additions to families, thriving on human interaction and forming strong bonds with children when properly socialised. <br/><br/>With consistent <strong>Staffy puppy care</strong> and positive training from an early age, their loving <strong>temperament</strong> truly shines. They are eager to please and love being part of family activities. Discover more about their wonderful characteristics on our <strong><a href=\"/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">home page</a></strong>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-qy2uduqo\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What is the life expectancy of a blue Staffy?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>A healthy blue Staffy typically has a life expectancy of <strong>12 to 14 years</strong>, though many live even longer with proper care. Factors like genetics, a balanced diet, regular exercise, and consistent veterinary care contribute significantly to their longevity. <br/><br/>As <strong>KC registered Staffy breeders</strong>, we prioritise extensive <strong>health screening</strong> to ensure our puppies are as robust as possible, reducing the risk of hereditary conditions. Investing in extensive <a href=\"/buy-blue-staffy-puppies-for-sale-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Staffy puppy care</strong> </a>from day one, including regular vet check-ups, will help ensure your beloved companion enjoys a long, happy life by your side.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-sbop2poo\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Are blue Staffies aggressive?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>No, <strong>blue Staffy puppies UK</strong> are not inherently aggressive. Despite unfair stereotypes, Staffordshire Bull Terriers are naturally affectionate, courageous, and loyal dogs known for their gentle nature towards people, especially children. Aggression in any dog breed typically stems from poor socialization, lack of training, or past negative experiences, not their inherent nature. <br/><br/>At BlueStaffyUK, our puppies are raised in a loving home environment with early socialization to foster their natural good <strong>temperament</strong>. We encourage responsible <strong>Staffy puppy care</strong> and continuous positive training to help your Staffy thrive as a well-adjusted family member.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-avzs88j1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Can blue Staffies be left alone?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Blue Staffies are highly people-oriented and thrive on companionship, making them ideally suited to families where they receive plenty of attention. While they can be trained to tolerate short periods of being alone (e.g., 2-4 hours for an adult dog), they are not a breed that should be left in isolation for extended durations. <br/><br/>Like many intelligent and affectionate dogs, they can develop separation anxiety or destructive behaviours if bored or lonely. Proper <strong>Staffy puppy care</strong> includes gradually introducing alone time. If you require <strong>Staffy puppy delivery UK</strong>, we provide a comprehensive <strong><a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-puppy-buying-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Puppy Buying Guide</a></strong> with tips on easing their transition and managing alone time.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-9ac3e80c\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Are Staffies hard to train?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Staffordshire Bull Terriers are intelligent and eager to please, which can make them very trainable. However, they can also be strong-willed, requiring consistent and firm training from a young age. Early socialisation and positive reinforcement methods work best. As mentioned on our About Us page, we focus on early socialisation to give our puppies a great start.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-c46d29aa\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>How long do Staffies sleep at night?</strong> </p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Adult dogs typically sleep around 12-14 hours a day, often including naps during the day. Puppies, including Staffy puppies, tend to sleep even more, around 18-20 hours, to support their growth and development.</p></div></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-vpptn0jp alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ivhr2zcv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Why UK Families Trust BlueStaffyUK</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">From first-time dog owners to lifelong Staffy lovers, our customers value the care, transparency, and lifelong support they receive. Read their heartfelt stories about finding their perfect pup.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-iw0zz0sc\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-wpmtdb0l\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-star-rating uagb-block-n12yutrp\"><div class=\"uag-star-rating\" title=\"5/5\"><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-4olsufwl uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">“The health checks, the communication, and the home-raised environment — everything was top-notch. I wouldn’t go anywhere else for a Staffy.”</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-knqsrqqd uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-image-content\"><img alt=\"Happy Blue Staffy puppy owner from London sharing a testimonial\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"437\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-testimonial-london-happy-owner.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-testimonial-london-happy-owner.webp 400w\" width=\"400\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">– Rachel L., London</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ucmty2v7\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-star-rating uagb-block-wzccfg5h\"><div class=\"uag-star-rating\" title=\"5/5\"><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-yjgbwceg uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">“My family had a Staffy years ago, but this experience was on a new level. The team genuinely cares about the puppies and the homes they go to.”</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-mzj1lueu uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-image-content\"><img alt=\"Smiling Daniel from Cardiff with his new Blue Staffy puppy, testimonial quote displayed\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-testimonial-cardiff-daniel.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-puppy-testimonial-cardiff-daniel.webp 640w\" width=\"640\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">– Daniel G., Cardiff</p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-epaptnpk alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-gpem9wmu uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valig